{"seq":16,"slug":"solutions-engineering","title":"解决方案工程","stage":"DONE","category":"cross-discipline","chapterCount":4,"docCount":15,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/solutions-engineering","rating":{"composite":3.67,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.63,"verdict":"consider","uScore":3.5}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"解决方案工程\">解决方案工程</h1><p>解决方案工程（Solutions Engineering，简称 SE），在不同公司也叫销售工程师（Sales Engineer）、售前工程师（Pre-sales Engineer）、解决方案架构师（Solutions Architect）、解决方案顾问（Solutions Consultant）——是 B2B 软件销售的&quot;技术发动机&quot;。当客户经理（Account Executive，简称 AE）与客户谈商业条款，SE 与客户的工程、架构、安全团队谈技术——为客户业务定制 demo、回答 RFP 上百道安全合规题、设计 POC（Proof of Concept）证明产品能解决痛点、在签约后把客户交接给客户成功团队（CSM）。Stripe、Snowflake、Databricks、HashiCorp、MongoDB、Twilio 等企业级 SaaS 公司，SE 团队规模常达销售团队的 60% 至 100%，每年承担数百万美元的 ARR 配额。SE 不只是 demo 工程师——它是技术叙事者、架构顾问、客户工程参谋、deal 关键节点的关单人。本 Hub 面向希望从工程师转 SE、组建 SE 团队、或评估 SE 投入的工程师与销售管理者，从基础（SE 定义 / 与 DevRel 与销售的边界 / 客户发现与资格筛选 / 销售周期与 deal 阶段）、技术功底（定制 demo 工程 / POC 设计 / 集成与架构映射 / 白板与技术叙事）、客户互动（discovery call 机制 / 高层与技术干系人 / 异议处理与竞品定位 / 交接客户成功）、SE 运营（工具与 demo 环境 / 度量与配额 / ramping 与赋能）四个维度给一条工程化路径。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[解决方案工程 SE] --&gt; B[1. SE 基础]&#10;    A --&gt; C[2. 技术功底]&#10;    A --&gt; D[3. 客户互动]&#10;    A --&gt; E[4. SE 运营]&#10;    B --&gt; F[定义 / 边界 / 发现 / 周期]&#10;    C --&gt; G[Demo / POC / 架构 / 白板]&#10;    D --&gt; H[Discovery / 干系人 / 异议 / 交接]&#10;    E --&gt; I[工具 / 度量 / ramping]\">graph TD\n    A[解决方案工程 SE] --&gt; B[1. SE 基础]\n    A --&gt; C[2. 技术功底]\n    A --&gt; D[3. 客户互动]\n    A --&gt; E[4. SE 运营]\n    B --&gt; F[定义 / 边界 / 发现 / 周期]\n    C --&gt; G[Demo / POC / 架构 / 白板]\n    D --&gt; H[Discovery / 干系人 / 异议 / 交接]\n    E --&gt; I[工具 / 度量 / ramping]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>章节</th>\n<th>核心概念</th>\n<th>实战代表</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>SE 基础</td>\n<td>定义、与销售/DevRel 边界、客户发现、销售周期</td>\n<td>Stripe、Snowflake、Databricks</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>技术功底</td>\n<td>定制 demo、POC、集成架构、白板叙事</td>\n<td>MongoDB、HashiCorp、Twilio</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>客户互动</td>\n<td>Discovery 机制、干系人、异议处理、交接</td>\n<td>Salesforce、Workday、ServiceNow</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>SE 运营</td>\n<td>工具与 demo 环境、度量与配额、ramping 与赋能</td>\n<td>AWS、Microsoft、Oracle</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>学完本 Hub，你能设计 discovery call 与资格筛选问题、为客户业务定制 demo、设计可量化的 POC 成功标准、应对常见异议与竞品比较、为 SE 团队设定度量、配额与 ramping 方案。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"se-foundations","title":"SE 基础","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/solutions-engineering/se-foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"what-is-solutions-engineering","title":"什么是解决方案工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/solutions-engineering/se-foundations/what-is-solutions-engineering"},{"seq":2,"slug":"se-vs-devrel-vs-sales","title":"SE 与 DevRel、销售的边界","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/solutions-engineering/se-foundations/se-vs-devrel-vs-sales"},{"seq":3,"slug":"customer-discovery-and-qualification","title":"客户发现与资格筛选","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/solutions-engineering/se-foundations/customer-discovery-and-qualification"},{"seq":4,"slug":"sales-cycle-and-deal-stages","title":"销售周期与 deal 阶段","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/solutions-engineering/se-foundations/sales-cycle-and-deal-stages"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"technical-craft","title":"技术功底","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/solutions-engineering/technical-craft","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"custom-demo-engineering","title":"定制 demo 工程","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/solutions-engineering/technical-craft/custom-demo-engineering"},{"seq":2,"slug":"poc-and-pilot-design","title":"POC 与 pilot 设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/solutions-engineering/technical-craft/poc-and-pilot-design"},{"seq":3,"slug":"integration-and-architecture-mapping","title":"集成与架构映射","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/solutions-engin